{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7ed72b5b3a069924ca072e86b0096c9d80e1dc5b94e487cfe94296af1e25b12",
      "text": "（问题在于，该让哪支组合出场呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a686f47c7bd8a9cb0119d1535ecfedc9bcc89fabe8be1878ffd91e002ee4defc",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n这份工作，请交给我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f246cb4dd69150cecf9b39b998780ffd6da2446ccdb7d48588782fd1769ca1",
      "text": "凉君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25754dd6c54442ea6b6b1374aa5e2c1fee7bd53231e7c9033d5b28e96eb3aef5",
      "text": "……我想通过展现自己决不放弃梦想的\n姿态，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d9de41e6323c9fb9f7119000b30b80e4c7e14c66811656450892edbf1f41ef",
      "text": "去推那些正打算放弃梦想的人一把。\n我是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da0eb9f91b0374e6d7bcf708375123795acf7f9588f612b82f64e70e3d4457f7",
      "text": "我之所以能下定如此坚定的决心，也是因为\n在加入315 Pro之前那段美妙的过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f993ff9ce4640775f6d271fdd5ee585447467e97e3658adbdff0eecfc22b1de",
      "text": "正因为有了过去，我们才能发出强烈的光芒。\n我们一定会将那份光芒传递给观众们的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00020fe6ce2f8bafbf9549760d0647fd868508359faa384554ad9d4db3147eaa",
      "text": "……啊，对、对不起！\n我擅自插话了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0feb922b6163d7a33edc998d5109ff2bb3de57a792d7204b4452aa7453e3263",
      "text": "大吾君、一希先生，对不起！没跟你们\n商量就自顾自说了这么果断的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a9a497140b38b5232ee79bc46d3f31066337f4f1fef6340c9e9230f67362c3b",
      "text": "…不，要是凉不说的话，\n我和大吾也会说出一样的话的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abbfd178b611bca7c84d33e99601b8bc2b307cbb6a176cc831c1f40af5d38d9c",
      "text": "是啊，老师说得对。\n刚才的凉，超级热血超级帅气的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b99ca8fd2b0cb487f428f02fbd05022429083ae542b357ba1deea1daf2a48c85",
      "text": "凉先生刚才的这番话语和心意，\n隔着电视也一定能够传达到的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5934f842725a738131e15611189fe093f9a14280c53a5c6db0a643bf937b97ce",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●老大！\n这么说，愿意交给我们了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce2849fb06b7f800beb4a86e3b04537fe8895430dbe37b7149f69521856e941",
      "text": "嗯，当然。这次的工作，\n就拜托F-LAGS的各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000153:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc28fc69b2ee84618f6926526597dabf64a0f6c2b0e9b84ef10a635e0ab45a13",
      "text": "Hi，●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n现在有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000163:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53d0c4aa8850a2f2b399f3bcc0363de47a5fe6d95b9144a26c75f8ca8ea9183b",
      "text": "拍摄顺利finish了，所以给你call一个哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000165:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99bf0206937d2ca012cfafda00a106e7e4ae8dc51431c3008d6a62156e45cbac",
      "text": "今天的写真拍摄，\n超级exciting超级开心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000167:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bc77d41ca23aef09f1f4300180604cf2587b58dcacafbf959d5815bd04da29c",
      "text": "大家摆了各种各样的pose。\n平时不怎么摆的那种pose也有哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000169:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9647ebaea73699a7cb5653acbe8ea4307ae5f131a83466cd288fbd5f9b1739f4",
      "text": "Mr. 硲和Mr. 山下虽然看起来\n都有点紧张……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000171:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4aa8be7118d69cae28b808001b7dc7f7617028d782e914f96f1418989325cd5",
      "text": "不过最后拍出了很cool的照片哦！感觉离大家共同\n瞄准的JIF也更近了一步呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000173:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8037124325938a3fc70fe09629adc5a2b699a29e4ed7ee28548eadf22befd176",
      "text": "数据应该已经送到了，\ncheck就拜托你了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000175:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03dc5db15ee59bc7e41c383c2af37e710847ddd1f0d0ae8f5c0330a42b5abe5c",
      "text": "还有，Mr. 硲说为了下一份工作，\n想听听制作人酱的感想呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_c:cmd-000177:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4832ddc6fd90910e26c3ac4c41712b41573f0575c1e16f993a6e5dfd1282d62",
      "text": "看了数据后记得联系我哦☆\n那么，see you later！Bye～☆",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
